$Aeon::Books["zGetStart","cntnt"] = "Now time to get Started! To answer the questions you are still wondering 'How do I get money?', 'How do I use terminals?', and 'Can I have free money?'... well no, you cannot have free money, and don't beg for it either! As for obtaining your own money, there are lots of ways, but starting out you will want to go Meteor Hunting! Occasionally watching the pretty moving skies, you may notice a Meteor fall from the sky, if you do, rush to that meteor impact site quickly and find the debris and rocks, and quickly while they are still hot, use your <f2>Construction Tool<f1> on them, fire and hold down the trigger until it finishes processing the mineral, and it will instantly convert into Cash in your wallet! That is the best way to get money when you are new, but there are other ways you can learn about later, by checking out more books at the Library! Any time you see something called a '<f2>Terminal<f1>' you can activate them by pressing your '<f2>Interact Key<f1>', which is your Grenade Key by default, and this also works on Doors and other objects as well, try it out around Central! Now that you know some of the basics, it's time to get out there and start Hunting Meteors and saving up for your own plot of land!";